   "date": "2026-10-06T17:15:29-05:00",
   "body": "The quest's suggested level is [b]32[/b], but the mobs you kill are all [b]27-30[/b]. Most classes can easily finish this quest when it's still orange in your quest log, so don't be thwarted by the apparently high level requirement of this quest!\n\nI had a [b]100% drop rate[/b] with this quest, but if you use the small area direct east of Fallen Sky Lake around [b]73, 80[/b], be advised the [b]shamans share spawns with grunts[/b]. In my first clear of the camp, I only saw 3 grunts for the [item=279505], but clearing a bunch of shamans in the area respawned more of them.",
